## case_rows_of_two_lengths (exit 1)
error[Z0217]: this `case` runs over 2 rows, but this arm gives 3 rows
 --> scripts/main.zeff:3:22
  |
3 | case { d["x"] > 1 => e["y"], _ => 0 }
  |                      ^^^^^^ a column of another length
  |
  = help: two columns combine only when they belong to the same frame or have the same length; `merge` joins frames first

